{"data":[{"id":14061579,"text":"I hope I can still access this website through normal means in a few months.","lang":"eng","script":null,"license":"CC BY 2.0 FR","owner":"jan_OkulaJu","is_unapproved":false,"translations":[{"id":14061575,"text":"\u6211\u5e0c\u671b\u8fc7\u51e0\u4e2a\u6708\u540e\u6211\u8fd8\u80fd\u901a\u8fc7\u6b63\u5e38\u624b\u6bb5\u767b\u4e0a\u8fd9\u4e2a\u7f51\u7ad9\u3002","lang":"cmn","script":"Hans","license":"CC BY 2.0 FR","owner":"jan_OkulaJu","is_unapproved":false,"is_direct":true}]},{"id":14059857,"text":"I also come from the countryside, so I have a first-hand understanding of poverty.","lang":"eng","script":null,"license":"CC BY 2.0 FR","owner":"rul","is_unapproved":false,"translations":[{"id":14059832,"text":"\u6211\u4e5f\u662f\u4ece\u519c\u6751\u51fa\u6765\u7684\uff0c\u5bf9\u8d2b\u56f0\u6709\u7740\u5207\u8eab\u611f\u53d7\u3002","lang":"cmn","script":"Hans","license":"CC BY 2.0 FR","owner":"rul","is_unapproved":false,"is_direct":true}]},{"id":14059821,"text":"There is a stark contrast between China's order and the chaos of the West.","lang":"eng","script":null,"license":"CC BY 2.0 FR","owner":"rul","is_unapproved":false,"translations":[{"id":14059777,"text":"\u4e2d\u56fd\u4e4b\u6cbb\u4e0e\u897f\u65b9\u4e4b\u4e71\u5f62\u6210\u4e86\u9c9c\u660e\u7684\u5bf9\u6bd4\u3002","lang":"cmn","script":"Hans","license":"CC BY 2.0 FR","owner":"rul","is_unapproved":false,"is_direct":true}]},{"id":14059764,"text":"Today, the greatest source of chaos in the world is the United States.","lang":"eng","script":null,"license":"CC BY 2.0 FR","owner":"rul","is_unapproved":false,"translations":[{"id":14059753,"text":"\u5f53\u4eca\u4e16\u754c\u6700\u5927\u7684\u4e71\u6e90\u5728\u7f8e\u56fd\u3002","lang":"cmn","script":"Hans","license":"CC BY 2.0 FR","owner":"rul","is_unapproved":false,"is_direct":true}]},{"id":14042163,"text":"I feel awful about the timing, but there's never a good time.","lang":"eng","script":null,"license":"CC BY 2.0 FR","owner":"Waldelfe","is_unapproved":false,"translations":[{"id":14042784,"text":"\u8fd9\u4e2a\u65f6\u673a\u5f88\u7cdf\u7cd5\uff0c\u4f46\u8fd9\u79cd\u4e8b\u6c38\u8fdc\u6ca1\u6709\u597d\u65f6\u5019\u3002","lang":"cmn","script":"Hans","license":"CC BY 2.0 FR","owner":"KUI","is_unapproved":false,"is_direct":true}]},{"id":14038496,"text":"\"Where did you buy this notebook?\" \"I bought it online.\" \"Send me the link.\"","lang":"eng","script":null,"license":"CC BY 2.0 FR","owner":"jan_OkulaJu","is_unapproved":false,"translations":[{"id":14038495,"text":"\u201c\u4f60\u8fd9\u4e2a\u672c\u5b50\u54ea\u91cc\u4e70\u7684\uff1f\u201d\u201c\u7f51\u4e0a\u4e70\u7684\u3002\u201d\u201c\u94fe\u63a5\u53d1\u6211\u3002\u201d","lang":"cmn","script":"Hans","license":"CC BY 2.0 FR","owner":"jan_OkulaJu","is_unapproved":false,"is_direct":true}]},{"id":14038226,"text":"If someone in the future invents a time machine, why don't they come back to visit us?","lang":"eng","script":null,"license":"CC BY 2.0 FR","owner":"jan_OkulaJu","is_unapproved":false,"translations":[{"id":14038225,"text":"\u5982\u679c\u672a\u6765\u6709\u4eba\u53d1\u660e\u4e86\u65f6\u5149\u673a\uff0c\u90a3\u4ed6\u4eec\u4e3a\u4ec0\u4e48\u4e0d\u56de\u6765\u770b\u6211\u4eec\u5462\uff1f","lang":"cmn","script":"Hans","license":"CC BY 2.0 FR","owner":"jan_OkulaJu","is_unapproved":false,"is_direct":true}]},{"id":14038183,"text":"Have you seen a little child wearing a grey\u2011and\u2011white striped shirt?","lang":"eng","script":null,"license":"CC BY 2.0 FR","owner":"jan_OkulaJu","is_unapproved":false,"translations":[{"id":14038180,"text":"\u4f60\u6709\u770b\u5230\u8fc7\u4e00\u4e2a\u7a7f\u7740\u7070\u767d\u6761\u7eb9\u886c\u886b\u7684\u5c0f\u5b69\u5b50\u5417\uff1f","lang":"cmn","script":"Hans","license":"CC BY 2.0 FR","owner":"jan_OkulaJu","is_unapproved":false,"is_direct":true}]},{"id":14037619,"text":"You may not have done it, but haven't you seen it done?","lang":"eng","script":null,"license":"CC BY 2.0 FR","owner":"jan_OkulaJu","is_unapproved":false,"translations":[{"id":14037609,"text":"\u6ca1\u5403\u8fc7\u732a\u8089\u8fd8\u6ca1\u89c1\u8fc7\u732a\u8d70\u5417\uff1f","lang":"cmn","script":"Hans","license":"CC BY 2.0 FR","owner":"jan_OkulaJu","is_unapproved":false,"is_direct":true}]},{"id":14037612,"text":"I may not have eaten pork, but I've seen a pig run.","lang":"eng","script":null,"license":"CC BY 2.0 FR","owner":"jan_OkulaJu","is_unapproved":false,"translations":[{"id":14037609,"text":"\u6ca1\u5403\u8fc7\u732a\u8089\u8fd8\u6ca1\u89c1\u8fc7\u732a\u8d70\u5417\uff1f","lang":"cmn","script":"Hans","license":"CC BY 2.0 FR","owner":"jan_OkulaJu","is_unapproved":false,"is_direct":true}]},{"id":14036404,"text":"The creation of most schools was not to transform society, but to reconstruct society.","lang":"eng","script":null,"license":"CC BY 2.0 FR","owner":"LeviHighway","is_unapproved":false,"translations":[{"id":502744,"text":"\u5927\u90e8\u5206\u5b66\u6821\u7684\u521b\u5efa\u4e0d\u662f\u7528\u6765\u8f6c\u53d8\u793e\u4f1a\uff0c\u800c\u662f\u7528\u6765\u91cd\u5efa\u793e\u4f1a\u7684\u3002","lang":"cmn","script":"Hans","license":"CC BY 2.0 FR","owner":"fucongcong","is_unapproved":false,"is_direct":true}]},{"id":14034682,"text":"Over the past six hours, Yacheng Town in our county has recorded 122.4\u202fmm of rainfall.","lang":"eng","script":null,"license":"CC BY 2.0 FR","owner":"jan_OkulaJu","is_unapproved":false,"translations":[{"id":14034678,"text":"\u8fc7\u53bb6\u5c0f\u65f6\uff0c\u6211\u53bf\u7259\u57ce\u9547\u964d\u96e8\u8fbe\u5230122.4\u6beb\u7c73\u3002","lang":"cmn","script":"Hans","license":"CC BY 2.0 FR","owner":"jan_OkulaJu","is_unapproved":false,"is_direct":true}]},{"id":14034666,"text":"I don't have an umbrella. Drive the car to the hospital inpatient entrance.","lang":"eng","script":null,"license":"CC BY 2.0 FR","owner":"jan_OkulaJu","is_unapproved":false,"translations":[{"id":14034665,"text":"\u6211\u6ca1\u5e26\u4f1e\u3002\u4f60\u628a\u8f66\u5f00\u5230\u4f4f\u9662\u90e8\u95e8\u53e3\u6765\u3002","lang":"cmn","script":"Hans","license":"CC BY 2.0 FR","owner":"jan_OkulaJu","is_unapproved":false,"is_direct":true}]},{"id":14029684,"text":"If there is a \"but\" in a sentence, everything before it is just fluff.","lang":"eng","script":null,"license":"CC BY 2.0 FR","owner":"jan_OkulaJu","is_unapproved":false,"translations":[{"id":14029683,"text":"\u5982\u679c\u4e00\u53e5\u8bdd\u91cc\u6709\u201c\u4f46\u662f\u201d\uff0c\u90a3\u4e48\u201c\u4f46\u662f\u201d\u4e4b\u524d\u7684\u90fd\u662f\u5e9f\u8bdd\u3002","lang":"cmn","script":"Hans","license":"CC BY 2.0 FR","owner":"jan_OkulaJu","is_unapproved":false,"is_direct":true}]},{"id":14028857,"text":"If symptoms do not ease after taking Suxiao Jiuxin Pills, take nitroglycerin immediately.","lang":"eng","script":null,"license":"CC BY 2.0 FR","owner":"jan_OkulaJu","is_unapproved":false,"translations":[{"id":14028856,"text":"\u5982\u679c\u670d\u7528\u901f\u6548\u6551\u5fc3\u4e38\u540e\u75c7\u72b6\u5e76\u672a\u7f13\u89e3\uff0c\u8bf7\u7acb\u5373\u670d\u7528\u785d\u9178\u7518\u6cb9\u3002","lang":"cmn","script":"Hans","license":"CC BY 2.0 FR","owner":"jan_OkulaJu","is_unapproved":false,"is_direct":true}]},{"id":14028314,"text":"After many years of grueling training, she finally made a breakthrough and won the championship.","lang":"eng","script":null,"license":"CC BY 2.0 FR","owner":"enclectm","is_unapproved":false,"translations":[{"id":14028313,"text":"\u7ecf\u8fc7\u591a\u5e74\u7684\u523b\u82e6\u8bad\u7ec3\uff0c\u5979\u7ec8\u4e8e\u7834\u8327\u6210\u8776\uff0c\u8d62\u5f97\u4e86\u51a0\u519b\u3002","lang":"cmn","script":"Hans","license":"CC BY 2.0 FR","owner":"enclectm","is_unapproved":false,"is_direct":true}]},{"id":14023217,"text":"Having a disability does not mean that you can be ableist towards other people or maintain ableist frameworks.","lang":"eng","script":null,"license":"CC BY 2.0 FR","owner":"mexicanhere","is_unapproved":false,"translations":[{"id":14023279,"text":"\u8eab\u6709\u6b8b\u75be\uff0c\u5e76\u4e0d\u4ee3\u8868\u4f60\u5c31\u53ef\u4ee5\u5bf9\u4ed6\u4eba\u62b1\u6709\u6b8b\u969c\u6b67\u89c6\uff0c\u6216\u8005\u7ee7\u7eed\u56fa\u5b88\u90a3\u4e9b\u6b67\u89c6\u6b8b\u969c\u8005\u7684\u56fa\u6709\u89c2\u5ff5\u3002","lang":"cmn","script":"Hans","license":"CC BY 2.0 FR","owner":"jan_OkulaJu","is_unapproved":false,"is_direct":true}]},{"id":14011830,"text":"You want the horse to run fast, but you don't want to feed it grass.","lang":"eng","script":null,"license":"CC BY 2.0 FR","owner":"LeviHighway","is_unapproved":false,"translations":[{"id":14011829,"text":"\u53c8\u8981\u99ac\u5152\u597d\uff0c\u53c8\u8981\u99ac\u5152\u4e0d\u5403\u8349\u3002","lang":"cmn","script":"Hant","license":"CC BY 2.0 FR","owner":"LeviHighway","is_unapproved":false,"is_direct":true}]},{"id":14009886,"text":"This kind of question doesn't actually have an absolutely right or wrong answer.","lang":"eng","script":null,"license":"CC BY 2.0 FR","owner":"frpzzd","is_unapproved":false,"translations":[{"id":13998043,"text":"\u8fd9\u79cd\u95ee\u9898\u7684\u7b54\u6848\u5012\u6ca1\u6709\u7edd\u5bf9\u7684\u5bf9\u9519\u3002","lang":"cmn","script":"Hans","license":"CC BY 2.0 FR","owner":"jan_OkulaJu","is_unapproved":false,"is_direct":true}]},{"id":14002102,"text":"They all say I sound like someone from the north, but I'm actually from the south.","lang":"eng","script":null,"license":"CC BY 2.0 FR","owner":"jan_OkulaJu","is_unapproved":false,"translations":[{"id":14002101,"text":"\u4ed6\u4eec\u90fd\u8bf4\u6211\u7684\u53e3\u97f3\u50cf\u5317\u65b9\u4eba\uff0c\u4f46\u6211\u5176\u5b9e\u662f\u5357\u65b9\u4eba\u3002","lang":"cmn","script":"Hans","license":"CC BY 2.0 FR","owner":"jan_OkulaJu","is_unapproved":false,"is_direct":true}]},{"id":14002061,"text":"The major dialects spoken in Fujian Province include Min, Hakka, Wu, Gan, and Nanping Mandarin.","lang":"eng","script":null,"license":"CC BY 2.0 FR","owner":"jan_OkulaJu","is_unapproved":false,"translations":[{"id":14002060,"text":"\u798f\u5efa\u7701\u7684\u4e3b\u8981\u65b9\u8a00\u6709\u95fd\u8bed\u3001\u5ba2\u5bb6\u8bdd\u3001\u5434\u8bed\u3001\u8d63\u8bed\u3001\u5357\u5e73\u5b98\u8bdd\u3002","lang":"cmn","script":"Hans","license":"CC BY 2.0 FR","owner":"jan_OkulaJu","is_unapproved":false,"is_direct":true}]},{"id":14001280,"text":"What is two to the power of four multiplied by three plus four squared plus three?","lang":"eng","script":null,"license":"CC BY 2.0 FR","owner":"jan_OkulaJu","is_unapproved":false,"translations":[{"id":14001279,"text":"2\u76844\u6b21\u65b9\u4e583\u52a04\u7684\u5e73\u65b9\u52a03\u662f\u591a\u5c11\uff1f","lang":"cmn","script":"Hans","license":"CC BY 2.0 FR","owner":"jan_OkulaJu","is_unapproved":false,"is_direct":true}]},{"id":13990652,"text":"The free-range eggs from this farm are darker in color, and the yolks are extraordinarily delicious.","lang":"eng","script":null,"license":"CC BY 2.0 FR","owner":"Babelball","is_unapproved":false,"translations":[{"id":13537423,"text":"\u9019\u5bb6\u8fb2\u5834\u7684\u8349\u96de\u86cb\u984f\u8272\u504f\u6df1\uff0c\u86cb\u9ec3\u7279\u5225\u9bae\u7f8e\u3002","lang":"cmn","script":"Hant","license":"CC BY 2.0 FR","owner":"LeviHighway","is_unapproved":false,"is_direct":true}]},{"id":13987304,"text":"This was the first time in Yuka's life that she finished reading an English book.","lang":"eng","script":null,"license":"CC BY 2.0 FR","owner":"LeviHighway","is_unapproved":false,"translations":[{"id":811915,"text":"\u9019\u662f\u512a\u9999\u751f\u547d\u4e2d\u7b2c\u4e00\u6b21\u8b80\u5b8c\u4e00\u672c\u82f1\u8a9e\u66f8\u3002","lang":"cmn","script":"Hant","license":"CC BY 2.0 FR","owner":"Martha","is_unapproved":false,"is_direct":true}]},{"id":13981164,"text":"\"We still need to get cash out.\" \"No we don't. We'll just pay by card.\"","lang":"eng","script":null,"license":"CC BY 2.0 FR","owner":"araneo","is_unapproved":false,"translations":[{"id":13982163,"text":"\u300c\u6211\u5011\u9084\u5f97\u53bb\u9818\u73fe\u91d1\u3002\u300d\u300c\u4e0d\u7528\uff0c\u5237\u5361\u4ed8\u6b3e\u5c31\u597d\u3002\u300d","lang":"cmn","script":"Hant","license":"CC BY 2.0 FR","owner":"LeviHighway","is_unapproved":false,"is_direct":true}]},{"id":13980380,"text":"I don't want to take a simple thing and make it complicated.","lang":"eng","script":null,"license":"CC BY 2.0 FR","owner":"frpzzd","is_unapproved":false,"translations":[{"id":13885142,"text":"\u6211\u4e0d\u60f3\u628a\u7b80\u5355\u7684\u4e8b\u60c5\u641e\u590d\u6742\u3002","lang":"cmn","script":"Hans","license":"CC BY 2.0 FR","owner":"jan_OkulaJu","is_unapproved":false,"is_direct":true}]},{"id":13980371,"text":"Health is more important than wealth. Is this statement true? Or is it false?","lang":"eng","script":null,"license":"CC BY 2.0 FR","owner":"frpzzd","is_unapproved":false,"translations":[{"id":13240136,"text":"\u5065\u5eb7\u6bd4\u8ca1\u5bcc\u91cd\u8981\u3002\u9019\u53e5\u8a71\u662f\u5c0d\u5462 ? \u6216\u662f\u932f\u5462 ?","lang":"cmn","script":"Hant","license":"CC BY 2.0 FR","owner":"mimosawang","is_unapproved":false,"is_direct":true}]},{"id":13971874,"text":"If anything important comes up, tag me so I can see it right away when I check messages.","lang":"eng","script":null,"license":"CC BY 2.0 FR","owner":"jan_OkulaJu","is_unapproved":false,"translations":[{"id":13971873,"text":"\u5982\u679c\u6709\u4ec0\u4e48\u91cd\u8981\u7684\u4e8b\u60c5\uff0c\u4f60\u53ef\u4ee5@\u6211\uff0c\u8fd9\u6837\u6211\u67e5\u770b\u6d88\u606f\u65f6\u5c31\u80fd\u7b2c\u4e00\u65f6\u95f4\u770b\u5230\u3002","lang":"cmn","script":"Hans","license":"CC BY 2.0 FR","owner":"jan_OkulaJu","is_unapproved":false,"is_direct":true}]},{"id":13970777,"text":"While video platforms do not explicitly ban such content, works of this type will have their traffic restricted.","lang":"eng","script":null,"license":"CC BY 2.0 FR","owner":"jan_OkulaJu","is_unapproved":false,"translations":[{"id":13970770,"text":"\u867d\u7136\u89c6\u9891\u5e73\u53f0\u6ca1\u6709\u660e\u786e\u7981\u6b62\u6b64\u7c7b\u5185\u5bb9\uff0c\u4f46\u8fd9\u79cd\u7c7b\u578b\u7684\u4f5c\u54c1\u7684\u6d41\u91cf\u4f1a\u88ab\u9650\u5236\u3002","lang":"cmn","script":"Hans","license":"CC BY 2.0 FR","owner":"jan_OkulaJu","is_unapproved":false,"is_direct":true}]},{"id":13970284,"text":"It's much easier to recognise Chinese characters than it is to write them.","lang":"eng","script":null,"license":"CC BY 2.0 FR","owner":"Adelpa","is_unapproved":false,"translations":[{"id":13972141,"text":"\u8a8d\u6f22\u5b57\u6bd4\u5beb\u6f22\u5b57\u5bb9\u6613\u591a\u4e86\u3002","lang":"cmn","script":"Hant","license":"CC BY 2.0 FR","owner":"LeviHighway","is_unapproved":false,"is_direct":true}]},{"id":13963435,"text":"The idea that all Chinese people speak one language is one of the most common misconceptions about China.","lang":"eng","script":null,"license":"CC BY 2.0 FR","owner":"Adelpa","is_unapproved":false,"translations":[{"id":13980577,"text":"\u8a8d\u70ba\u5168\u4e2d\u570b\u7684\u4eba\u90fd\u8b1b\u540c\u4e00\u7a2e\u8a9e\u8a00\uff0c\u662f\u4e00\u7a2e\u5c0d\u4e2d\u570b\u6700\u5e38\u898b\u7684\u8aa4\u89e3\u3002","lang":"cmn","script":"Hant","license":"CC BY 2.0 FR","owner":"LeviHighway","is_unapproved":false,"is_direct":true}]},{"id":13957908,"text":"The criterion of the scientific status of a theory is its falsifiability, or refutability, or testability.","lang":"eng","script":null,"license":"CC BY 2.0 FR","owner":"jan_OkulaJu","is_unapproved":false,"translations":[{"id":13957909,"text":"\u4e00\u4e2a\u7406\u8bba\u7684\u79d1\u5b66\u5730\u4f4d\u7684\u6807\u51c6\u662f\u5b83\u7684\u53ef\u8bc1\u4f2a\u6027\u3001\u53ef\u53cd\u9a73\u6027\u6216\u53ef\u68c0\u9a8c\u6027\u3002","lang":"cmn","script":"Hans","license":"CC BY 2.0 FR","owner":"jan_OkulaJu","is_unapproved":false,"is_direct":true}]},{"id":13953760,"text":"Zhejiang Province is located on the southeastern coast of China and belongs to the East China region.","lang":"eng","script":null,"license":"CC BY 2.0 FR","owner":"jan_OkulaJu","is_unapproved":false,"translations":[{"id":13953757,"text":"\u6d59\u6c5f\u7701\u5730\u5904\u4e2d\u56fd\u4e1c\u5357\u6cbf\u6d77\uff0c\u96b6\u5c5e\u4e8e\u534e\u4e1c\u5730\u533a\u3002","lang":"cmn","script":"Hans","license":"CC BY 2.0 FR","owner":"jan_OkulaJu","is_unapproved":false,"is_direct":true}]},{"id":13949886,"text":"He couldn't find the restroom, so he had to ask the shopkeeper for directions.","lang":"eng","script":null,"license":"CC BY 2.0 FR","owner":"frpzzd","is_unapproved":false,"translations":[{"id":13610519,"text":"\u4ed6\u627e\u4e0d\u5230\u6d17\u624b\u9593\uff0c\u53ea\u597d\u5411\u5e97\u54e1\u8a62\u554f\u65b9\u5411\u3002","lang":"cmn","script":"Hant","license":"CC BY 2.0 FR","owner":"LeviHighway","is_unapproved":false,"is_direct":true}]},{"id":13947897,"text":"The Summer Solstice is the day with the longest daytime hours of the year.","lang":"eng","script":null,"license":"CC BY 2.0 FR","owner":"jan_OkulaJu","is_unapproved":false,"translations":[{"id":13947895,"text":"\u590f\u81f3\u662f\u4e00\u5e74\u4e2d\uff0c\u65e5\u663c\u65f6\u95f4\u6700\u957f\u7684\u4e00\u5929\u3002","lang":"cmn","script":"Hans","license":"CC BY 2.0 FR","owner":"jan_OkulaJu","is_unapproved":false,"is_direct":true}]},{"id":13947296,"text":"Could you tell me the stroke order of the character \"\u8001\" in the word \"\u5e74\u8001\"?","lang":"eng","script":null,"license":"CC BY 2.0 FR","owner":"jan_OkulaJu","is_unapproved":false,"translations":[{"id":13947294,"text":"\u4f60\u80fd\u544a\u8bc9\u6211\u201c\u5e74\u8001\u201d\u7684\u201c\u8001\u201d\u5b57\u7684\u7b14\u987a\u5417\uff1f","lang":"cmn","script":"Hans","license":"CC BY 2.0 FR","owner":"jan_OkulaJu","is_unapproved":false,"is_direct":true}]},{"id":13947295,"text":"Could you tell me the stroke order of the character \"l\u01ceo\" in the word \"ni\u00e1nl\u01ceo\"?","lang":"eng","script":null,"license":"CC BY 2.0 FR","owner":"jan_OkulaJu","is_unapproved":false,"translations":[{"id":13947294,"text":"\u4f60\u80fd\u544a\u8bc9\u6211\u201c\u5e74\u8001\u201d\u7684\u201c\u8001\u201d\u5b57\u7684\u7b14\u987a\u5417\uff1f","lang":"cmn","script":"Hans","license":"CC BY 2.0 FR","owner":"jan_OkulaJu","is_unapproved":false,"is_direct":true}]},{"id":13940946,"text":"Those who help others through hard times often can't get through their own.","lang":"eng","script":null,"license":"CC BY 2.0 FR","owner":"jan_OkulaJu","is_unapproved":false,"translations":[{"id":13940938,"text":"\u5e2e\u52a9\u4ed6\u4eba\u5ea6\u8fc7\u96be\u5173\u7684\u4eba\uff0c\u5374\u65e0\u6cd5\u5ea6\u8fc7\u81ea\u5df1\u7684\u96be\u5173\u3002","lang":"cmn","script":"Hans","license":"CC BY 2.0 FR","owner":"jan_OkulaJu","is_unapproved":false,"is_direct":true}]},{"id":13940944,"text":"It's hard to stay objective and calm when it happens to you.","lang":"eng","script":null,"license":"CC BY 2.0 FR","owner":"jan_OkulaJu","is_unapproved":false,"translations":[{"id":13940935,"text":"\u5f53\u4e8b\u60c5\u53d1\u751f\u5728\u81ea\u5df1\u8eab\u4e0a\u65f6\uff0c\u5c31\u65e0\u6cd5\u5ba2\u89c2\u51b7\u9759\u5730\u5904\u7406\u3002","lang":"cmn","script":"Hans","license":"CC BY 2.0 FR","owner":"jan_OkulaJu","is_unapproved":false,"is_direct":true}]},{"id":13936747,"text":"The person who gets the highest salary at the company does the least work.","lang":"eng","script":null,"license":"CC BY 2.0 FR","owner":"jan_OkulaJu","is_unapproved":false,"translations":[{"id":13936746,"text":"\u516c\u53f8\u91cc\u5de5\u8d44\u6700\u9ad8\u7684\u4eba\uff0c\u53ea\u7528\u5e72\u6700\u5c11\u7684\u6d3b\u3002","lang":"cmn","script":"Hans","license":"CC BY 2.0 FR","owner":"jan_OkulaJu","is_unapproved":false,"is_direct":true}]},{"id":13922483,"text":"So many Chinese characters have been accepted into Unicode. Are all of them actually used?","lang":"eng","script":null,"license":"CC BY 2.0 FR","owner":"frpzzd","is_unapproved":false,"translations":[{"id":13896544,"text":"Unicode\u91cc\u6536\u4e86\u8fd9\u4e48\u591a\u4e2d\u6587\u5b57\u7b26\uff0c\u6709\u4e9b\u771f\u7684\u6709\u7528\u5417\uff1f","lang":"cmn","script":"Hans","license":"CC BY 2.0 FR","owner":"jan_OkulaJu","is_unapproved":false,"is_direct":true}]},{"id":13921104,"text":"The piano is a chord instrument, while the flute is a monophonic instrument.","lang":"eng","script":null,"license":"CC BY 2.0 FR","owner":"jan_OkulaJu","is_unapproved":false,"translations":[{"id":13921101,"text":"\u94a2\u7434\u662f\u548c\u5f26\u4e50\u5668\uff0c\u7b1b\u5b50\u662f\u5355\u97f3\u4e50\u5668\u3002","lang":"cmn","script":"Hans","license":"CC BY 2.0 FR","owner":"jan_OkulaJu","is_unapproved":false,"is_direct":true}]},{"id":13908291,"text":"I'm going to defenestrate myself if I hear the \"SIX-SEVEN\" meme one more time.","lang":"eng","script":null,"license":"CC BY 2.0 FR","owner":"mexicanhere","is_unapproved":false,"translations":[{"id":13999392,"text":"\u5982\u679c\u518d\u8ba9\u6211\u542c\u5230\u4e00\u6b21\u201c67\u201d\u8fd9\u4e2a\u6897\uff0c\u6211\u5c31\u628a\u6211\u81ea\u5df1\u4ece\u7a97\u6237\u6254\u4e0b\u53bb\u3002","lang":"cmn","script":"Hans","license":"CC BY 2.0 FR","owner":"jan_OkulaJu","is_unapproved":false,"is_direct":true}]},{"id":13902344,"text":"A vast and sophisticated system is usually based on a few simple rules.","lang":"eng","script":null,"license":"CC BY 2.0 FR","owner":"jan_OkulaJu","is_unapproved":false,"translations":[{"id":13902321,"text":"\u5e9e\u5927\u800c\u7cbe\u5999\u7684\u4f53\u7cfb\u5f80\u5f80\u5efa\u7acb\u5728\u51e0\u4e2a\u7b80\u5355\u7684\u89c4\u5219\u4e4b\u4e0a\u3002","lang":"cmn","script":"Hans","license":"CC BY 2.0 FR","owner":"jan_OkulaJu","is_unapproved":false,"is_direct":true}]},{"id":13886751,"text":"I don't have the patience to go clothes shopping with my wife.","lang":"eng","script":null,"license":"CC BY 2.0 FR","owner":"jan_OkulaJu","is_unapproved":false,"translations":[{"id":10461330,"text":"\u6211\u6c92\u6709\u4efb\u4f55\u8010\u5fc3\u548c\u6211\u59bb\u5b50\u4e00\u8d77\u53bb\u8cb7\u8863\u670d\u3002","lang":"cmn","script":"Hant","license":"CC BY 2.0 FR","owner":"DaoSeng","is_unapproved":false,"is_direct":true}]},{"id":13879519,"text":"You have so many experiences, so could you tell me how old you are?","lang":"eng","script":null,"license":"CC BY 2.0 FR","owner":"jan_OkulaJu","is_unapproved":false,"translations":[{"id":1169515,"text":"\u4f60\u6709\u8fd9\u4e48\u591a\u7684\u751f\u6d3b\u9605\u5386\uff0c\u6562\u95ee\u4f60\u5e74\u65b9\u51e0\u4f55\uff1f","lang":"cmn","script":"Hans","license":"CC BY 2.0 FR","owner":"sysko","is_unapproved":false,"is_direct":true}]},{"id":13858164,"text":"Living away from family, receiving, now and then, friends' concern can be particularly touching.","lang":"eng","script":null,"license":"CC BY 2.0 FR","owner":"DaoSeng","is_unapproved":false,"translations":[{"id":13832487,"text":"\u5728\u7570\u9109\u751f\u6d3b\uff0c\u5076\u723e\u6536\u5230\u670b\u53cb\u7684\u95dc\u61f7\u8b93\u4eba\u500d\u611f\u6eab\u6696\u3002","lang":"cmn","script":"Hant","license":"CC BY 2.0 FR","owner":"LeviHighway","is_unapproved":false,"is_direct":true}]},{"id":13858162,"text":"As a stranger in a strange land, the sporadic solicitude from friends can be especially heart-warming.","lang":"eng","script":null,"license":"CC BY 2.0 FR","owner":"DaoSeng","is_unapproved":false,"translations":[{"id":13832487,"text":"\u5728\u7570\u9109\u751f\u6d3b\uff0c\u5076\u723e\u6536\u5230\u670b\u53cb\u7684\u95dc\u61f7\u8b93\u4eba\u500d\u611f\u6eab\u6696\u3002","lang":"cmn","script":"Hant","license":"CC BY 2.0 FR","owner":"LeviHighway","is_unapproved":false,"is_direct":true}]},{"id":13852675,"text":"He didn't not come because he was sick, but because his wife wouldn't let him.","lang":"eng","script":null,"license":"CC BY 2.0 FR","owner":"araneo","is_unapproved":false,"translations":[{"id":13991928,"text":"\u4ed6\u6c92\u4f86\u4e0d\u662f\u56e0\u70ba\u751f\u75c5\uff0c\u800c\u662f\u56e0\u70ba\u8001\u5a46\u4e0d\u8b93\u3002","lang":"cmn","script":"Hant","license":"CC BY 2.0 FR","owner":"LeviHighway","is_unapproved":false,"is_direct":true}]},{"id":13807530,"text":"I ran as fast as I could, but I missed the last train.","lang":"eng","script":null,"license":"CC BY 2.0 FR","owner":"tieguy","is_unapproved":false,"translations":[{"id":13999065,"text":"\u6211\u62fc\u547d\u5730\u8dd1\uff0c\u4f46\u9084\u662f\u932f\u904e\u4e86\u672b\u73ed\u8eca\u3002","lang":"cmn","script":"Hant","license":"CC BY 2.0 FR","owner":"LeviHighway","is_unapproved":false,"is_direct":true}]}],"paging":{"total":3365,"has_next":true,"next":"https:\/\/api.tatoeba.org\/v1\/sentences?lang=eng&trans%3Alang=cmn&trans%3Ais_direct=yes&is_unapproved=no&is_orphan=no&trans%3Ais_unapproved=no&trans%3Ais_orphan=no&showtrans=matching&limit=60&sort=created&word_count=13-18&after=1773712441%2C13807530"}}
